msgstr "**指标**：性能和缓存统计信息"

#: ../../source/api_reference/configurations.rst:281
msgid "**Configuration**: Runtime configuration inspection"
msgstr "**配置**：运行时配置检查"

#: ../../source/api_reference/configurations.rst:282
msgid "**Metadata**: Engine and model metadata"
msgstr "**元数据**：引擎和模型元数据"

#: ../../source/api_reference/configurations.rst:283
msgid "**Threads**: Thread debugging information"
msgstr "**线程**：线程调试信息"

#: ../../source/api_reference/configurations.rst:284
msgid "**Log Level**: Dynamic log level adjustment"
msgstr "**日志级别**：动态日志级别调整"

#: ../../source/api_reference/configurations.rst:285
msgid ""
"**Script Execution**: Run custom Python scripts with access to the "
"LMCache engine"
msgstr "**脚本执行**：运行可访问 LMCache 引擎的自定义 Python 脚本"

