msgid "LMCACHE_INTERNAL_API_SERVER_PORT_START"
msgstr "LMCACHE_INTERNAL_API_SERVER_PORT_START"

#: ../../source/api_reference/configurations.rst:305
msgid ""
"Starting port for internal API server. Port assignment: Scheduler = "
"port_start + 0, Worker i = port_start + i + 1. Example: If "
"port_start=6999, then Scheduler=6999, Worker 0=7000, Worker 1=7001, etc. "
"Default: 6999"
msgstr "内部 API 服务器的起始端口。端口分配：调度器 = port_start + 0，工作进程 i = port_start + i + 1。示例：如果 port_start=6999，则调度器=6999，工作进程 0=7000，工作进程 1=7001，依此类推。默认值：6999"

#: ../../source/api_reference/configurations.rst:306
msgid "internal_api_server_include_index_list"
msgstr "internal_api_server_include_index_list"

#: ../../source/api_reference/configurations.rst:307
msgid "LMCACHE_INTERNAL_API_SERVER_INCLUDE_INDEX_LIST"
msgstr "LMCACHE_INTERNAL_API_SERVER_INCLUDE_INDEX_LIST"

#: ../../source/api_reference/configurations.rst:308
msgid ""
"List of worker/scheduler indices to enable API server on. Use 0 for "
"scheduler, 1 for worker 0, 2 for worker 1, etc. If null, enables on all "
"workers/scheduler. Example: [0, 1] enables only on scheduler and worker "
"0. Default: null"
msgstr "要启用 API 服务器的工作进程/调度器索引列表。使用 0 表示调度器，1 表示工作进程 0，2 表示工作进程 1，依此类推。如果为 null，则在所有工作进程/调度器上启用。示例：[0, 1] 仅在调度器和工作进程 0 上启用。默认值：null"

#: ../../source/api_reference/configurations.rst:309
msgid "internal_api_server_socket_path_prefix"
msgstr "internal_api_server_socket_path_prefix"

#: ../../source/api_reference/configurations.rst:310
msgid "LMCACHE_INTERNAL_API_SERVER_SOCKET_PATH_PREFIX"
msgstr "LMCACHE_INTERNAL_API_SERVER_SOCKET_PATH_PREFIX"

#: ../../source/api_reference/configurations.rst:311
msgid ""
"If specified, use Unix domain sockets instead of TCP ports. Socket paths "
"will be \"{prefix}_{port}\". Example: \"/tmp/lmcache_api_socket\" creates"
" \"/tmp/lmcache_api_socket_6999\", \"/tmp/lmcache_api_socket_7000\", etc."
" Default: null"
msgstr "如果指定，则使用 Unix 域套接字而不是 TCP 端口。套接字路径将为 \"{prefix}_{port}\"。示例：\"/tmp/lmcache_api_socket\" 创建 \"/tmp/lmcache_api_socket_6999\"、\"/tmp/lmcache_api_socket_7000\" 等。默认值：null"

